OL,3,GNEWSAMajor city road closed following
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of a major road in Leicester
OL,7,Fhas been closed following a crash.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,10,Fcrash involving a motorbike and two
OL,11,Fcars in Narborough Road South at 15:01
OL,12,FBST on Wednesday, Leicestershire Fire
OL,13,Fand Rescue Service said.
OL,15,FLeicestershire Police said the road was
OL,16,Fclosed between the junctions of Fosse
OL,17,FPark Avenue and Braunstone Lane East.
OL,19,FPolice have advised people to avoid the
OL,20,Farea and find alternative routes.
